"""Patina 0.35.0: a string course at every floor line (the factory's roadmap 324).

`framing.string_course_orders` orders a band over the recessed slab edge at every floor line of a building that is not
an Empty, each slot's band judged by the opening keep-out alone and the survivors joined into runs.

Proven: tests/test_string_courses.py fails on 0.34.0 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone's suite (suite_clone.out.txt);
the slice rebuilt and priced (the factory's docs/findings/slice_look/).
"""
